entries[178153] = { ["name"] = "Selfless Watcher's Helm", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nHead Cloth\n10 Armor\n+15 Intellect\n+22 Stamina\n+ 10 Versatility\n+ 19 Mastery\nDurability 100 / 100\nComplete Chapter 6 of your Covenant Campaign\n\nVestments of the Selfless (0/9)\nSelfless Watcher's Chestplate\nSelfless Watcher's Cloak\nSelfless Watcher's Gauntlets\nSelfless Watcher's Girdle\nSelfless Watcher's Helm\nSelfless Watcher's Legguards\nSelfless Watcher's Shoulders\nSelfless Watcher's Warboots\nSelfless Watcher's Wristwraps\n(3) Set : Increases your out-of-combat regeneration in outdoor Shadowland zones. While in your Covenant's realm, the regeneration amount is increased.\n(5) Set : Phial of Serenity grants 70 Primary Stat for 30 sec. Removing a disease, poison, curse, or bleed increases the amount granted by 50%.\n(8) Set : Your spells and abilities have a chance to cause your target to erupt in a blinding light dealing 577 Arcane damage or healing an ally for 709 health.\nSell Price:" }
